  "body": "A query string-based (and, therefore, IE/Edge-incompatible) [test](https://hsivonen.com/test/moz/iso-2022-jp-encoder.htm) shows that Gecko, WebKit, Blink and Presto can encode half-width Katakana as ISO-2022-JP without NCRs.\r\n\r\nThe spec should be amended to match (both encoder and decoder side).",
